# Water reclaimer (BACKLOG #49): front with an Oven beside it for scale, a side view for the tube, a close view. On the real generated pad (top block y 80).
wait 100
cmd /gamerule doDaylightCycle false
cmd /gamerule doWeatherCycle false
cmd /weather clear
cmd /time set 6000
cmd /mars go
wait 300
cmd /setblock 0 81 4 mars:water_reclaimer[facing=north]
cmd /setblock 3 81 4 mars:regolith_oven[facing=north]
wait 60
view 1.5 83 -4 0 12
wait 80
shot reclaimer_front
wait 20
view 5 83 4.5 90 12
wait 60
shot reclaimer_side_tube
wait 20
view 0.5 82.5 0 0 10
wait 60
shot reclaimer_close
wait 20
quit
